WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.956
Adobe is dropping huge updates across Creative Cloud

00:00:03.956 --> 00:00:07.120
to help you make your most ambitious work.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.240
Your best ideas need your full attention.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.060
Welcome back to the update. I'm Hippie Potter.

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:16.620
And I'm Zoe Unlimited.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:21.120
First up, the next era of Premiere is here.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:24.520
With Color Mode, I can make the grade I imagine my way.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.870
Plus, generate video, images, soundscapes, and music

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:29.283
right from your timeline

00:00:29.283 --> 00:00:31.760
with the new generative media tool in Premiere.

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:34.959
And with AI audio tools, Premiere brings more

00:00:34.959 --> 00:00:37.456
of the video creation process together

00:00:37.456 --> 00:00:40.180
in one end-to-end editing platform.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:41.760
Next up, Photoshop.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:44.894
With new ways to work smarter,

00:00:44.894 --> 00:00:47.355
simplify complex tasks, and get more creative control

00:00:47.355 --> 00:00:49.520
to realize your exact vision.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.820
Put your image in a whole new light with Relight.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.400
I can change the mood of a shot without reshooting.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.608
Plus, with Quick Compare, now you can see

00:00:58.608 --> 00:00:59.440
your before and after with a slider.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:03.418
And don't forget, generative restyle so you can

00:01:03.418 --> 00:01:06.020
explore new directions with precise control.

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:09.534
Then, there's Firefly Design Beta that helps you

00:01:09.534 --> 00:01:12.880
design across mediums and stay on one canvas.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:16.375
It's a new web-based design editor in Firefly

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:19.710
that brings vector, raster, motion, 3D, and print

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:21.100
together on one canvas.

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:23.681
Your logo, your poster, and your animation

00:01:23.681 --> 00:01:24.880
all in one file.

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:26.966
And last, more time to make it yours

00:01:26.966 --> 00:01:29.200
across Creative Cloud.

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:32.350
Creative Cloud is launching AI assistants across your favorite products

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:34.700
to help you tackle repetitive tasks.

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:37.385
In products like Illustrator, that means

00:01:37.385 --> 00:01:38.540
easily organizing and batching edits.

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:40.926
In Premiere, AI system beta takes on

00:01:40.926 --> 00:01:42.963
the work around the work,

00:01:42.963 --> 00:01:45.000
like organizing bins and syncing clips.

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:47.236
I'd much rather spend that hour

00:01:47.236 --> 00:01:49.160
finding the perfect cut.

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:50.509
I'm handing off renaming

00:01:50.509 --> 00:01:52.140
my Photoshop layers immediately.

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.080
Alright, so what's the take?

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.522
I'm going to start playing around with these

00:01:56.522 --> 00:01:57.840
new ways to finesse this color and lighting.

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:01.288
Color mode in Premiere and Relight in Photoshop

00:02:01.288 --> 00:02:02.400
all in one release?

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:04.800
That's a lot of new looks to try.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.680
And that's the update.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.620
Update your apps to try them all.
